## Interface: 16001
## Title: Lvls!
## Notes: A leveling route computed for your character: step by step, with an arrow, on the map and minimap.
## Category: Quests
## Author: Erik Andersen
## Version: 0.1.2
## SavedVariables: LvlsDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: LvlsCharDB
## OptionalDeps: QuestieDB
